* r68's \# counts empty arguments too (a,, is 3; a,b,,,,,,, is 9), as's NARG doesn't: the count
* is set before the call (r68__narg) and captured by the expansion; an empty argument is <> (as's
* MRI macros dropped a bare one from NARG); after byte data the lines put before a call get no
* line marker (as aligns at one after an odd dc.b), one is written later.
* fixed: 9d8fa34 2026-10-11 r68togas: \# counts empty arguments; no line marker after byte data
* expect text: 01020309 09020000
CNT macro
 dc.b \#
 endm
 psect narg_empty,0,0,0,0,0
 CNT a
 CNT a,b
 CNT a,,
 CNT a,b,,,,,,,
 CNT a,,,,,b,c,d,e
 CNT ,b
 CNT
 dc.b 0
 ends
